  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.8 - AM030 null-guard fixer precision\n\n            Changed:\n            - Hardened AM030 nullable-source converter fixes to generate fully qualified null guards without adding System usings\n            - Preserved existing using directives, global usings, file-scoped namespaces, and multi-diagnostic fixer behavior\n            - Added AM030 code fix regression coverage for less invasive null-guard rewrites\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 with targeted AM030 code fix coverage\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.7 - AM022 recursion boundary precision",
